title: "Incremental value of plasma TMAO in cardiovascular risk prediction"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for estimating whether plasma trimethylamine N-oxide adds
  predictive value to a conventional cardiovascular risk model, assessed by
  discrimination, calibration, reclassification and net benefit.
